    "text": "By Bryan Alonso ,\n7 hours ago PENDER COUNTY, NC (WWAY)– Next week, the Pender County Board of education is going to have a meeting that could determine the fate of parent run booster programs. Football, Basketball, and Baseball, these are just some of the sports programs in Topsail High School that were funded by the now suspended Topsail Athletic Boosters Organization. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
